00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.230
Koushi-dono, are you watching?

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.180
Alright! She got it right!

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.720
Sis, sis.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.010
Koushi onii-chan saw that too, right?

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.180
Uh... Koushi-kun isn't here.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:05.800
Eh?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.600
Why at an important time like this?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:09.790
What happened?

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.740
Onii-chan, where did you go?

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:14.690
I went to bring back the laundry.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:17.360
Hanzo will do that.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.900
Please watch the TV, onii-chan.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:20.940
Eh?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.290
But the one who wanted to watch TV is...

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:25.680
Never mind that, just leave the laundry to me.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:27.250
Thanks.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.630
The questions will get harder from now on!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.890
The theme is cooking!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.370
Shoot Momoko senpai!

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:35.880
What's wrong, Momoko-chan?

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.480
It's nothing...

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.960
Cooking is my best...

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.410
Here is the question.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:47.090
Note: "Sa, shi, su, se, so" are five basic syllables in Japanese.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:47.090
In the "sa-shi-su-se-so" of cooking, "sa" is for sugar, "shi" is for salt, "su" is for vinegar, and "se" is for soy sause.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.540
Then what does "so" represent?

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:50.320
Yes!

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.020
Red challenger!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:52.930
It's the miso!

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:53.870
Correct!

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:57.100
Onii-chan, look, look!

00:12:57.950 --> 00:12:59.270
Just leave it...

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.020
Hanzo!

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:02.160
See? She got angry.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:05.200
Onii-chan, the TV, watch the TV!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:05.990
Eh?

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.120
That looks delicious.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.480
Now to think of it, I'm getting really hungry.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:12.080
He missed it again...

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.910
Now comes the final question.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:18.230
Your score will be doubled if you answers this correctly.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.560
Everyone has a chance to win.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:21.970
Question!

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:25.110
Monkey hands, backscratchers, and bear hands.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:32.170
Which one of them is considered to be one of the most luxurious ingredients in Chinese cuisine?

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:34.180
Red challenger.

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:35.410
Bear hands.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:36.820
Correct!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:41.400
The winner is the red challenger, Kuzuryuu Momoko-san!

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:42.600
Amazing!

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:45.050
Momoko senpai won!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.580
Onii-chan, hurry...

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.490
Huh?

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.250
Hey, where is onii-chan?

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:49.820
Huh?

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.510
You are right, where did he go?

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:52.580
Hanzo!

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.470
Onii-chan, what are you doing?

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.370
I'm kinda hungry, so I thought to microwave some pizza.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:02.720
I'll do that.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.700
Go watch the TV, onii-chan.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.400
Hurry up!

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:10.160
What's all the "TV TV" about?

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:14.240
Sorry you had to help me iron.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.540
Forget about that, just watch the TV!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:17.890
Watch the TV!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.210
You guys were yelling "TV TV" since a while ago.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.340
Is it that good?

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:26.050
Why now!?

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:27.680
The circuit breaker tripped.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:33.960
Koushi-dono must've been so surprised after seeing me on TV.

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:36.250
And I even won first price.

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.230
I'm sure the weariness is gone now.

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:41.900
On the box: Please take her, her name is Byako.

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:46.580
Abandoned cat...?

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:47.900
Poor thing...

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.450
Tip five of "the seven tips to make your husband look back at you"...

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:53.610
Get a pet.

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:58.760
Pets should be able to pull a couple closer together.

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:04.100
We might be able to get even closer if we have her.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.740
I'm home!

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:07.520
Oh.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.510
Iroha-dono left?

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.040
How did you know?

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.900
Eh? Ah. No...

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.690
They were acting really weird.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.910
They kept on telling me to watch the TV.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.900
It's not like there is anything good on.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.410
You didn't watch?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.050
Huh? No.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.520
I was kinda busy.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.910
Oh, by the way, I did the laundry.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.580
Thank you...

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:34.840
The period of weariness continues...

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:41.240
I think I just heard a cat cry...

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:42.840
My imagination?

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.790
Do you hate cats?

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:46.550
No.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.240
I hate all animals.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:51.630
Huh?

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.870
I'll prepare the bath, and we'll have dinner afterwards.

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:03.660
We should keep you as a secret for the time being.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.200
Be a good kitty and stay here.

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:13.450
And now, the decisive sixth tip of "the seven tips to make your husband look back at you".

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.120
I'm risking everything on this one!

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.880
My change...

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.920
Translation: I ♥ Momoko.

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.100
Hello~?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.380
Yes~?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.150
Translation: I ♥ Koushi-dono.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:27.170
Did you call?

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.150
Eh!?

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.630
...What's this?

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.510
You mean this?

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.270
It's the materialization of love.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.310
Huh?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:40.830
The sixth tip of "the seven tips to make your husband look back at you", express the love in a physical form.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:44.410
Time can gradually fade love away.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:47.490
So try to express it in a physical form.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.340
The mutual affection...

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.420
I adore Koushi-dono.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:53.640
What about Koushi-dono...?

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:54.800
What about Koushi-dono?

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:56.810
No!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.410
Eh!?

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:58.760
Please wear it...

00:16:58.850 --> 00:16:59.730
How can I!?

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.210
It looks so embarrassing.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.630
No... Koushi-dono...

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.620
Geez... What was she thinking?

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.410
What happened here!?

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.070
Did a robber come in?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.370
What is that!?

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.850
I found her abandoned...

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.960
So I thought to keep her...

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:36.680
No.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:37.560
No way...

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.330
The more families we have, the merrier!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:42.240
I said no.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.090
Put it back to where you found it.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.510
I can't do that...

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.900
If you can't do it, I'll do it for you.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:49.680
Give it to me.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.580
Gimme, gimme, gimme, gimme, gimme, gimme, gimme, gimme!

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:56.570
Let's keep her!

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:57.990
Absolutely not.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:00.940
I'll leave too, if you throw her out...

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:02.980
No matter what you say, a "no" is a "no".

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.080
You are so mean!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.370
Uh... Where is the dinner?

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:27.670
I didn't prepare it.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.290
Have a cup of instant noodles.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.330
I see... OK.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.340
I have to wait for three minutes...

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.740
This is delicious.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:50.040
Koushi-dono doesn't need someone like me!

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.780
Fano-san's seven tips didn't work...

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.130
Fano-san?

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:58.370
And you think instant noodles taste better than my cooking...

00:18:58.840 --> 00:18:59.890
As a woman...

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.060
As your wife...

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.360
I have nothing to provide to Koushi-dono...

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:07.800
I feel so lonely...

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:11.010
Hey, I didn't say instant noodles are more delicious...

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.270
Hey, this cat looks hungry.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:18.650
You sure you want to leave it alone?

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:22.490
I'm sorry Byako, I'll make something for you.

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:26.300
Byako, is it good?

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:29.700
I made Koushi-dono's share too, as a bonus.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.780
It's sablefish meuniere.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.810
Translation: Favorite.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:43.350
Hey, this is mine.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.170
I said it's mine!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.480
Here, just a little.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.960
What are you smiling about?

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.410
It's so much fun to have dinner together.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:02.330
I don't mind the weariness anymore.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.890
No matter what happens.

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:09.010
I'll be with Koushi-dono.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:10.990
I'll bring out the dessert.

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:12.820
Just wait a second.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:13.340
Ah.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.700
I forgot.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:18.020
Here.

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:19.220
Shoes?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.640
I bought them for you.

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:24.360
I asked class rep to help me choosing it.

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:27.490
I don't know much about girl cloth.

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.370
Koushi-dono...

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:32.190
Wear it to school at least.

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:34.360
It's embarrassing if you don't.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.620
The seventh tip of "the seven tips to make your husband look back at you"...

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.110
It's yourself.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:41.070
Men are shy.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.580
Try to understand them.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:47.200
Though he may not say it, but I'm sure he loves you.

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:52.470
I love you too!

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:53.540
What are you talking about!?

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.540
Sorry, I got the wrong size.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:00.460
It's okay, this is okay.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.890
On the box: Please feed me.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:01.430
Huh?

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:04.640
I wonder what's inside.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.630
I wonder.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.940
Sorry to disturb.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.780
Wait, Inuzuka.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:19.600
Yo, it's been a while.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:20.800
Who are you?

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.230
Momoko...

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.460
Momoko...

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:25.550
This voice...

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.680
No... Don't tell me...

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:29.960
Tenka?

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:31.890
The tiger assassin?

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:34.660
Western Branch Shindara Rettetsu Style
Kogane Tenka

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.230
Kogane Tenka!?

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:36.880
That's right.

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.920
Is this your friend?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.750
You know, the assassin!

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:43.380
What?

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:44.730
Momoko...

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:51.260
May tonight be...

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:51.260
今夜もしかして

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:51.260
konya moshikashite

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:55.690
Le... Le... Le... Le... Le... Let's fight!

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:55.690
ガッガッガッガガガチで勝負する

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:55.690
gaggaggaggaga gachide shoubu suru

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.710
It's a fight between maidens.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.710
乙女の闘い

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.710
otome no tatakai

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:04.480
It's where love leads to.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:04.480
恋の行く末はいざいざ

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:04.480
koi no yukusue wa izaiza

