Even if I was treated unfairly.

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.650
むちゃむちゃされても

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.650
muchamucha saretemo

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:24.850
Even if I was punished.

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:24.850
おしおきされても

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:24.850
oshioki saretemo

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:28.110
I will follow you bare footed.

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:28.110
裸足でついてく

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:28.110
hadashi de tsuiteku

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:31.870
Side steps to the left and to the right.

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:31.870
反復横とび　左へ　右へ

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:31.870
hanfukuyokotobi　hidari e　migi e

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:34.890
Deeper than the sea.

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:34.890
海より深くて

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:34.890
umi yori fukakute

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:38.020
Higher than the sky.

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:38.020
空より高いの

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:38.020
sora yori takai no

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:43.020
The burst of imaginations is too painful.

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:43.020
はじける妄想切なすぎ

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:43.020
hajikeru mousou setsunasugi

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:45.770
I will devote my everything.

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:45.770
しみじみ　しちゃうよ

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:45.770
shimijimi　shichauyo

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:49.590
They are turning pink.

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:49.590
薄紅色した

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:49.590
usubeniiro shita

